Generate Python code that creates a pytest wrapper with fixtures for Playwright to automate web browsers:
```python
import pytest
from playwright.sync import Playwright

@pytest.fixture(scope='function')
def playwright():
   return Playwright()

@pytest.mark.parametrize('url', ['http://example.com', 'https://example.com'])
def test_browser(playwright, url):
   browser = playwright.chromium.launch(url=url)
   assert browser.title() == 'Example Domain'
   browser.close()
```

